# Nanopb options file for fast_keymap.proto
#
# Deliberately empty of max_size/max_count entries: every `string` and
# `repeated` field in fast_keymap.proto must stay a nanopb CALLBACK field
# (pb_callback_t) so the response streams straight into the Studio RPC
# transport ring buffer instead of being buffered whole in a plain struct.
# See DESIGN.md SS3 and skills/zmk-module-dev/SKILL.md. Do not add max_size
# / max_count options here -- that would turn a field back into a bounded
# plain-struct (STATIC) field, defeating streaming.
